{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43317","headline":"文宣王庙古松 · 李胄","name":"文宣王庙古松","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"列植成均里，分行古庙前。\n阴森非一日，苍翠自何年。\n寒影烟霜暗，晨光枝叶妍。\n近檐阴更静，临砌色相鲜。\n每愧闻钟磬，多惭接豆笾。\n更宜教胄子，於此学贞坚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李胄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43317.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43317","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}